{"id":"458114","name":"蒲公英龙骨汤","author":"天使落凡尘","authorId":"378319","desc":"","cover":"images/458114/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"龙骨","amount":"300克"},{"name":"萝卜","amount":"200克"},{"name":"干蒲公英","amount":"10克"},{"name":"红枣","amount":"2颗"},{"name":"枸杞","amount":"5克"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜片","amount":"适量"},{"name":"食盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"八角","amount":"适量"},{"name":"花椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"陈皮","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香叶","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好食材。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/12/201905121557654842156124378319.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":2,"desc":"龙骨先用水焯一次去除血末后清洗干净。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/12/201905121557654842740457378319.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":3,"desc":"萝卜切块。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/12/201905121557654842955897378319.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":4,"desc":"找一个耐热容器放入适量清水，龙骨，蒲公英，萝卜，红枣和枸杞，把香料放入香料盒中丢进去。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/12/201905121557654843047192378319.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":5,"desc":"蒸烤箱100度或110度蒸100分钟。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/12/201905121557654843129356378319.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":6,"desc":"取出来加盐搅拌均匀，撒上香菜或者葱花点缀。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/12/201905121557654849334226378319.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"}],"tips":"1、阳虚外寒、脾胃虚弱者忌用蒲公英。\n2、香料放盒子里或者纱布包起来，避免喝汤时候影响口感。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}